            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.57

- Line changes are cheaper to draw. Only the lines near enough to be seen now spring into place; the rest, which sit outside the visible area of a long song, simply take their position. On a typical display that is under half as much work per frame, with no visible difference.
]]></description>
